  "title": "Bab&#39;s Turkey Mushroom Lasagna Rolls",
  "description": "These tasty lasagna rolls have perfect portions of cheese, turkey, and mushrooms. Your whole family will love them.",
  "authors": [
    "Barbara Kahian"
  ],
